# Starhold

See root [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Vision/process: `docs/vision.md`, `docs/process.md`. Per-system only: `docs/design/<system>.md`.

**Gate:** rebase → `test` + `typecheck` + `build:vercel` → local Playwright (no Vercel preview) → UI dual-viewport if UI → KV additive → Micah approve. No auto-merge.

Commit the small `api/index.js` stub; `build:vercel` overwrites it. Do not commit the generated bundle or gitignore the stub. Deploys: `main` only.
